  "description": "Wheatpaste, words and mark: a pink sheet pasted over a photo, the words cut out of it (each line justified to the full width), the mark cut out beside the name; the photo ghosts through the sheet, glue creases catch the light. Square (release): the title in two lines over the mark and the name. Re-expressed from the Logomarks scenes lab (ZineCards, 'Wheatpaste · words and mark').",
